<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-LEADING GRAND PRIX DE LA MARSEILLAISE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-LEADING GRAND PRIX DE LA MARSEILLAISE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>AUBAGNE, France 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in</p>
<p>Tuesday's Grand Prix de La Marseillaise cycle race over 136 kms</p>
<p>from Vitrolles:</p>
<p>1. Richard Virenque (France)  three hours 24 minutes 29 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Gilles Bouvard (France)		     7 mins 3 secs behind</p>
<p>3. Jan Svorada (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>4. Elio Aggiano (Italy)</p>
<p>5. Servais Knaven (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6. Yvon Ledanois (France)</p>
<p> 7. Dominique Bozzi (France)		all same time</p>
<p> 8. Rolf Jaermann (Switzerland)				     9:30</p>
<p> 9. Rodolfo Massi (Italy)					same time</p>
<p> 10. Laurent Pillon (France)					 15:13</p>
</text>
